{"title":"2003 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 23","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the pattern below, the cat moves clockwise through the four squares,  and the mouse moves counterclockwise through the eight exterior segments of the four squares.\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:2003amc8prob23a.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/1/1a/2003amc8prob23a.png/800px-2003amc8prob23a.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"177\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/1/1a/2003amc8prob23a.png/1200px-2003amc8prob23a.png 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/1/1a/2003amc8prob23a.png 2x\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</center>\n<p>If the pattern is continued, where would the cat and mouse be after the 247th move?\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:2003amc8prob23b.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/e/ed/2003amc8prob23b.png/800px-2003amc8prob23b.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"175\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/e/ed/2003amc8prob23b.png/1200px-2003amc8prob23b.png 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/e/ed/2003amc8prob23b.png 2x\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</center>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Break this problem into two parts: where the cat will be after the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/9/0f9aeb6fed7e8972fc371b5dfebf60d96c5d539f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$247^{\\text{th}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" /> move, and where the mouse will be.\n</p><p>The cat has four possible positions in 1 cycle which are repeated every four moves. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/7/9b77d89340523f052502e586725d91b77d6c7d5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$247$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> has a remainder of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> when divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. This corresponds to the position the cat has after the 3rd move, which is the bottom right corner.\n</p><p>Similarly, the mouse has eight possible positions in 1 cycle that repeat every eight moves. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/7/9b77d89340523f052502e586725d91b77d6c7d5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$247$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> has a remainder of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> when divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. This corresponds to the position the mouse has after the 7th move which is bottom left corner. \n</p><p>The only arrangement with the mouse in that position and the cat in the bottom right square is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OxtaQkcJDfU\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OxtaQkcJDfU</a>   ~David\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8\" title=\"2003 AMC 8\">2003 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2003 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2003 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2003\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2003 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2003 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2003 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2003 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2003 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2003 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2003 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem